{"ID":"20240206105320-uy3iyuc","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206105320-uy3iyuc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105320-uy3iyuc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105331-n72bzpv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105325-0j00ght\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105331-n72bzpv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:202,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:202\u0026#125;","title":"木贼","type":"doc","updated":"20240830172434"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105331-n72bzpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105331-n72bzpv","updated":"20240206105334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产陕西、湖北以及东北地区。\n【性状】\t茎呈长管状，不分枝。长4060cm，直径约6mm。表面灰绿色或黄绿色，有1830条细纵纵棱，平直排列，棱脊上有2行细小的疣状突起，触之稍挂手。节上着生鳞处状合生的筒状叶鞘，叶鞘基部和先端具2圈棕黑色较宽的环。鞘片背面有2条棱脊及1条浅沟。质脆，易折断，断面中空。边缘有20"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30个小空腔，排列成环状，内有白色或浅绿色的薄瓤。气微，味微涩，嚼之有沙粒感。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，平。\n【功效】\t散风热，退目翳。用于风热目赤，迎风流泪，目生云翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105325-0j00ght","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105325-0j00ght","updated":"20240206105325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105325-5knay3o.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240714140632-co138kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714140632-co138kc","updated":"20240714173059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 455px;","style":"width: 445px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 12-20240714173058-jqoeanq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 445px;\" parent-style=\"width: 455px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 425px;","style":"width: 415px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 1-20240714140632-74cpvzp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 415px;\" parent-style=\"width: 425px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714141541-lp4sx0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714141541-lp4sx0o","updated":"20240714142053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 625px;","style":"width: 615px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 2-20240714140733-5uzprgd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 615px;\" parent-style=\"width: 625px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 11-20240714142053-hwdg820.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 557px;\" parent-style=\"width: 567px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714140843-crbqrpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714140843-crbqrpl","updated":"20240714172947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 292px;","style":"width: 282px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240714163931-pguyi4y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 282px;\" parent-style=\"width: 292px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 807px;","style":"width: 797px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 3-20240714140843-cj1g971.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 797px;\" parent-style=\"width: 807px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714141323-2evdrbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714141323-2evdrbo","updated":"20240714141931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 480px;","style":"width: 470px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 4-20240714140957-pewu4iz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 470px;\" parent-style=\"width: 480px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 5-20240714141043-iicck3q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 391px;","style":"width: 381px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 8-20240714141455-64qa30o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 381px;\" parent-style=\"width: 391px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240714141605-os3ewjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714141605-os3ewjj","updated":"20240714141618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 633px;","style":"width: 623px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 9-20240714141605-2yd9kap.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 623px;\" parent-style=\"width: 633px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 562px;","style":"width: 552px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼 7-20240714141323-t04nu1d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 552px;\" parent-style=\"width: 562px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714154904-oqqdb7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714154904-oqqdb7i","updated":"20240714163329"}},{"ID":"20240714161043-huosd60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714161043-huosd60","updated":"20240715080859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"木贼草、问荆草、节节草对比"}]},{"ID":"20240714161249-750r3au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714161249-750r3au","updated":"20240714161249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼草、问荆草、节节草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼草、问荆草、节节草-20240714161249-jovvokk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714161349-iw52k3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714161349-iw52k3l","updated":"20240714161412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（左为木贼、中为问荆草、右为节节草）"}]},{"ID":"20240714172903-rvxjo1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714172903-rvxjo1i","updated":"20240714172903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240714172903-02t1crj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714141836-e4u77em","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714141836-e4u77em","updated":"20240715081030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：木贼、问荆草、节节草三者较为相像。点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref strong","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240714160812-w1wp2jx","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"节节草"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref strong","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240714160823-f3ouj0x","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"问荆草（问金草）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240714161511-15bjl2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714161511-15bjl2m","updated":"20240714163119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"木贼茎节是三者之中最粗的，独立而没有分叉，偶尔出现三分之一的细分枝；木贼植株能长得很高，能达到一米甚至三米以上，又有记载戏称它为通天草；"}]},{"ID":"20240714161833-jwwzbpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714161833-jwwzbpg","updated":"20240714163250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"节节草的茎比木贼明显细，结突出分支明显比木贼多，丛生密集，高可达一米，一年生（有的人小时候会把它的节打开，加在眉毛头发上玩）；"}]},{"ID":"20240714162047-oifprhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714162047-oifprhi","updated":"20240714162227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"问荆草植株成熟后分枝开始环生，非常密集，植株高度在30-50厘米，常生长在田边（传说它是吸收土壤里的金元素生长的，所以有它的地方就有金子）；"}]},{"ID":"20240714162421-r1zyh7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714162421-r1zyh7d","updated":"20240714172840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三者无花无叶无果，都是靠顶部孢子结构繁殖；问荆草茎杆实心，其他两者是空心的；"}]},{"ID":"20240714141837-phnex72","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240714141837-phnex72"}},{"ID":"20240830172427-hjcb14a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-hjcb14a","updated":"20240830172434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：木贼"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-p9438e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-p9438e1","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木贼《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-zizm2y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-zizm2y6","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MùZéi"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-gaom5t1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-gaom5t1","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HERBAEQUISETIHIEMALIS"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-v6ohqgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-v6ohqgn","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】锉草、笔头草、笔筒草、节骨草"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-g40bpky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-g40bpky","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为木贼科植物木贼EquisetumhiemaleL.的干燥地上部分。夏、秋二季采割，除去杂质，晒干或阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-q08nxzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-q08nxzy","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈长管状，不分枝，长40～60cm，直径0.2～0.7cm。表面灰绿色或黄绿色，有18～30条纵棱，棱上有多数细小光亮的疣状突起；节明显，节间长2.5～9cm，节上着生筒状鳞叶，叶鞘基部和鞘齿黑棕色，中部淡棕黄色。体轻，质脆，易折断，断面中空，周边有多数圆形的小空腔。气微，味甘淡、微涩，嚼之有沙粒感。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-0a40swv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-0a40swv","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去枯茎及残根，喷淋清水，稍润，切段，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-cgybob7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-cgybob7","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-u19dn1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-u19dn1b","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-tg4cvji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-tg4cvji","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】散风热，退目翳。用于风热目赤，迎风流泪，目生云翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-41hb50n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-41hb50n","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-yqor7ny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-yqor7ny","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-yd8sj1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-yd8sj1k","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-sbgw3pi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-sbgw3pi","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木贼《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-uwnkwuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-uwnkwuq","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《嘉佑本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-2ntnjgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-2ntnjgl","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MùZéi"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-i5vt0kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-i5vt0kx","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】木贼草（《木草经疏》），锉草（《盛京通志》），节节草（《植物名实图考》），节骨草（《东北药植志》），擦草、无心草（《山西中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-hwh690s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-hwh690s","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为木贼科植物木贼的全草。夏、秋采收，割取地上部分，按粗细扎成小捆，阴干或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-b3ymktd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-b3ymktd","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高50厘米以上。根茎短，黑色，匍匐，节上长出密集成轮生的黑褐色根。茎丛生，坚硬，直立不分枝，圆筒形，直径4～8毫米，有关节状节，节间中空，茎表面有20～30条纵肋棱，每棱有两列小疣状突起。叶退化成鳞片状，基部合生成筒状的鞘，鞘长6～10毫米，基部有1暗褐色的圈，上部淡灰色，先端有多数棕褐色细齿状裂片，裂片披针状锥形，先端长，锐尖，背部中央有1浅沟，裂片早落，仅在茎先端及幼茎上者不脱落。孢子囊穗生于茎顶，长圆形，长1～1.5厘米，先端具暗褐色的小尖头，由许多轮状排列的六角形盾状孢子叶构成，沿孢子叶的边缘生敖个胞子囊，孢子囊大形。孢子多数，同型，圆球形，有2条丝状弹丝，十字形着生，卷绕在孢子小，遇水即弹开，以便繁殖。孢子囊穗6～8月间抽出。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-k4h1lfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-k4h1lfl","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山坡林下阴湿处、河岸湿地、溪边，喜阴湿的环境，有时也生于杂草地。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北、安徽、湖北、四川、贵州、云南、山西、陕西、甘肃、内蒙古、新疆、青海等地。主产东北及陕西、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-ggxrb6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-ggxrb6m","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥全草，呈长管状，中空有节，不分枝。长30～60厘米，直径约5毫米，每节长3～6厘米。表面灰绿色或黄绿色，有多数纵枝，顺直排列，其上密生细刺，触之有粗糙感。节处有筒状深棕色的鳞叶。易自节处拔脱。质脆，易折断，断面中空，内有灰白色或浅绿色的薄瓤。气无，味甘，微苫涩。以茎粗长、色绿、质厚、不脱节者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-w72c4ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-w72c4ck","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】洗净，稍润，剪去根部，切段，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-41rp6ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-41rp6ir","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-83g0ex5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-83g0ex5","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-1xtvdmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-1xtvdmk","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《嘉祜本草》：\"味甘微苦，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-ol9rnuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-ol9rnuq","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-oalh92c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-oalh92c","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正》：\"味微苦微甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-7yvz7s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-7yvz7s9","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-fxuk27h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-fxuk27h","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肺、肝、胆经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-phj6sre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-phj6sre","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-dhukdwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-dhukdwk","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入足厥阴、少阳二经血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-i8qpyyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-i8qpyyt","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"入手、足三阳经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-v4hvp6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-v4hvp6l","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-bgp623r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-bgp623r","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疏风散热，解肌，退翳。治目生云翳，迎风流泪，肠风下血，血痢，脱肝，疟疾，喉痛，痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-16yzi77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-16yzi77","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《嘉祜本草》：\"主目疾，退翳膜。又消积块，益肝胆，明目，疗肠风，止痢及妇人月水不断。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-10h2xa3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-10h2xa3","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"解肌，止泪，止血，去风湿，疝痛，大肠脱肛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-j0ev7gw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-j0ev7gw","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正》：\"发汗，解肌。治伤寒，疟疾。去风湿，散火邪。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-h2tec8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-h2tec8q","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《玉楸药解》：\"平疮疡肿硬，吐风狂痰涎。治痈疽瘰疬，疔毒，疖肿，汗斑，粉渣，崩中赤白诸证。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-jeiydbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-jeiydbh","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-0ncvka5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-0ncvka5","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-eirrzgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-eirrzgc","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气血虚者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-zow9e3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-zow9e3d","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"目疾由于怒气及暑热伤血、暴赤肿痛者，非其所任。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-jb0oxyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-jb0oxyt","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》：\"多服损肝，不宜久服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-49869vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-49869vt","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"多用令人目肿，若久翳及血虚者非所宜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-oy0d3vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-oy0d3vb","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-famgara","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-famgara","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治目障昏蒙多泪：木贼草（去节）一两，为末，和羊肝捣为丸，早晚各食后服二钱，白汤下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-qykf954","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-qykf954","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治目昏多泪：木贼（去节），苍术（泔浸）各一两。为末，每服二钱，茶凋下，或蜜丸亦可。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-h9sp6yc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-h9sp6yc","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治风寒湿邪，欲发汗者：木贼草（去节）一两，生姜、葱白各五钱。水煎热饮，即汗。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-8l3u9f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-8l3u9f1","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治肠风下血：木贼（去节，炒）一两，木馒（炒）、枳壳（制）、槐角（炒）、茯苓、荆芥各五钱。上为末，每服二钱，浓煎枣汤调下。（《仁斋直指方》木贼散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-zghe9tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-zghe9tk","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治血痢不止：木贼五钱，水煎温服。一日一服。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-4uj1ziz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-4uj1ziz","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治脱肛历年不愈：木贼不以多少，烧存性，为末，掺肛门上，按之。（《三因方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-2iwb3um","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-2iwb3um","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治月水不断：木贼（炒）三钱，水一盏煎七分，温服。日一服。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-p7tn2pk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-p7tn2pk","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治外伤出血，消化道出血，妇科出血及其它出血：木贼50％，黄柏20％，益母草20％，五倍子10％。分别研末，过120目筛，混匀。外用：将药粉撒布创面，用纱布压迫。内服；每次二克，每四至六小时一次。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-dynueas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-dynueas","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治胎动不安：木贼（去节）、川芎等分。为末，每服三钱，水一盏，入金银花一钱煎服。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-q66cpvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-q66cpvw","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治咽喉红痛：鲜木贼草捣绞汁调蜜服。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-mci99vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-mci99vu","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治浮肿型脚气、皮肤病性肾炎、水肿：木贼草四钱五分，浮萍三钱，赤豆三两，红枣六枚。水煎，一日三次分服。（《现代实用中药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-qfhp2my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-qfhp2my","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治舌硬出血：木贼煎水，漱之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-k2g53es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-k2g53es","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀目昏多泪。用木贼（去节）、苍术（淘米水泡过）各一两，共研为末。每服二钱，茶调下。或加蜜做成丸子吞服亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-dzf4cc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-dzf4cc2","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁急喉痹塞。用木贼在牛粪火上烧存性，每服一钱，冷水送下，血出即安。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-cm7pdyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-cm7pdyj","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂血痢不止。用木贼五钱，水煎，温服。一天服一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-g2u6f2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-g2u6f2r","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃泻血不止。方同上，一天服二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-o78soe3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-o78soe3","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄肠痔下血。用木贼、枳壳各二两，干姜一两，大黄二钱半，一起在锅内炒黑存性，研细。每服二钱，粟米汤送下。甚效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-4blr3e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-4blr3e2","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅大肠脱肛。用木贼（烧存性）研为末，敷肛部，并把它托入体内。药中加龙骨亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-9qu29w9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-9qu29w9","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆妇女血崩。用木贼、香附子各一两，朴硝半两，共研为末。每服三钱，血色黑者用酒一碗煎，血色赤者用水一碗煎，连渣服下。一天服二次。脐下痛者，加乳香、没药、当归各一钱同煎。忌食生冷硬物及猪、鱼、面等。此方名\"雷氏木贼散\"。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-xuec1it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-xuec1it","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇月经不净。用木贼（炒）三钱，加水一碗煎至七成，温服，每天服一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-yt0m9ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-yt0m9ze","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）胎动不安。用木贼（去节）、川芎，等分为末。每服三钱，水一碗，加金银一钱煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-w4hi923","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-w4hi923","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）小肠疝气。用木贼锉细，微炒为末。沸汤送服二钱，有效。以热酒送下亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-9h5rfpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-9h5rfpm","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-8pe779y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-8pe779y","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治疗牛皮癣"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-3f658zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-3f658zk","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木贼注射液，每次肌肉注射2毫升，每日2次，半月为一疗程；如无不良反应，可连续应用。治疗99例，基本痊愈4例，显效49例。疗效最快者经注射15次后即达到基本治愈，但一般需注射70～80次。极个别病例用药后皮损反见增加而停药。用药后未见毒性不良反应，远期疗效待继续观察。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-cofz8ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-cofz8ik","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗硅肺"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-ga0h39d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-ga0h39d","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对改善症状有一定效果。据36例观察，服药后咳嗽、咳痰、气喘、胸痛、心悸均有不同程度的减轻或消失，但X线胸片、心电图及肺功能检查则无明显变化。制剂及用法：㈠流浸膏：日服2次，每次10毫升，每日量相当生药100克。㈡糖浆剂：每次5毫升，15～30天后改为每次10毫升，均日服3次；每日量相当生药37.5～75克，副作用：服药初期有口干、肠鸣等反应，连续服药15～30天后自行消失；服流浸膏的有3人出现颜面色素沉着，可能与叶绿素渣质吸收有关，停药后短期内消失。此外，发现有17.6％的病例肝功能有一定损害，可能由于服药时间长、剂量大、疗程无间隙有关。如每日服相当75克生药的流浸膏，2个月为一疗程，同时加用保肝药物，可能起到保护肝功能的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-ommm6nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-ommm6nt","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】云南、广东、广西等地尚以同属植物纤细木贼（笔管草）的全草作木贼使用。参见\"土米贼\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-jz8ijta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-jz8ijta","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-sv42axz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-sv42axz","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木贼《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-ox26bwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-ox26bwn","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《嘉佑本草》：木贼得牛角鳃、麝香，治休息痢历久不差。得禹余粮、当归、穹穷，疗崩中赤白。得槐鹅、桑耳，肠风下血服之效。又与槐子、枳实相宜，主痔疾出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-sesg3cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-sesg3cf","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MùZéi"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-1hvhka8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-1hvhka8","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CommonScouringRushHerb，HerbofCommonScouringRush，HerbofDutchRushes，HerbofRoughHorsetail，HerbofScouringRush"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-krglftx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-krglftx","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】木贼草、锉草、节节草、节骨草、响草、接骨叶、笔杆草、笔筒草、擦草、无心草、笔头草、笔管草"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-tupfetk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-tupfetk","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-kei7sq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-kei7sq8","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为木贼科植物木贼的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-o7s7j5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-o7s7j5e","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Hippochaetehiemale(L.)Borher[EquisetumhiemaleL.]"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-0uugzck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-0uugzck","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋采收，割取地上部分，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-xjknnqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-xjknnqj","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】木贼，多年生草本，高50cm以上。根茎短，黑色，匍匐，节上长出密集成轮生的黑褐色根。茎丛生，坚硬，直立不分枝，圆筒形，直径4-8mm，有关节状节，节间中空，茎表面有20-30条纵肋棱，每棱有两列小疣状突起。叶退化成鳞片状，基部合生成筒状的鞘，鞘长6-10mm，基部有1暗褐色的圈，上部淡灰色，先端有多数棕褐色细齿状裂片，裂片披针状锥形，先端长，锐尖，背部中央有1浅沟，裂片早落，仅在茎先端及幼茎上者不脱落。孢子囊穗生于茎顶，长圆形，长1-1.5cm，先端具暗褐色的小尖头，由许多轮状排列的六角形盾状孢子叶构成，沿孢子叶的边缘生数个胞子囊，孢子囊大形。孢子多数，同型，圆球形，有2条丝状弹丝，十字形着生，卷绕在孢子上，遇水即弹开，以便繁殖。孢子囊穗6-8月间抽出。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-41rtk1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-41rtk1g","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-0ipnvdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-0ipnvdt","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山坡林下阴湿处、河岸湿地、溪边。有时也生于杂草地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-0bzz7er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-0bzz7er","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、西北、华中、西南。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-3v1z059","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-3v1z059","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-589jlfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-589jlfk","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.生物学特性木贼喜潮湿，生于山坡、河岸湿地，喜直射阳光。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-z7f16kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-z7f16kc","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.栽培技术孢子繁殖：采下孢子后立即播于土壤表面，稍覆土保持湿度。分茎繁殖：将根茎切成3-6cm长的节段，栽于土壤中，覆土4-5cm，常浇水，很易生根成活。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-wpsxggx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-wpsxggx","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-vp8xqma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-vp8xqma","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.性状鉴定茎长管状，平直，长20-60cm，直径2-6mm，节明显，节间长2.5-9cm，无分枝。表面灰绿色或黄绿色，有纵棱20-30条，棱上有多数细小光亮的疣状突起，有粗糙感。节处有鞘状叶。鞘筒基部和鞘齿棕黑色，中部淡黄色。体轻，质脆，易折断，断面中空，周边有多数圆形小空腔。气微，味甘、淡、微涩，嚼之有砂粒感。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-rrrjj0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-rrrjj0t","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.显微鉴别茎横切面：类圆形或略扁。表皮细胞1列，外表面角质化，有疣状突起，沟内有2列凹陷的气孔，保卫细胞表面观呈长半圆形，表面有放射纹理。表皮内方为皮层厚壁组织，呈楔形伸入皮层薄壁组织中，每棱间有一空腔，内皮层内外2列，外列呈波状环形，内列呈圆环形，均可见明显凯氏点。维管束外韧型，排列在2列内皮层之间，位于外列内皮层的波状凸起内侧，与棱角相对，维管束内侧有一束内腔。内皮层内方为髓薄壁细胞，扁缩，中央为髓腔。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-1w5fqx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-1w5fqx2","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】地上部分含挥发油，其中有机酸为琥珀酸（succinicacid），延胡索酸（fumaricacid），戊二酸甲酸（glutaricacidmethylester），对羟基苯甲酸（p-hydroxybenzoicacid），间羟基苯甲酸（m-hydroxybenzoicacid），阿魏酸（ferulicacid），香草酸（vanillicacid），咖啡酸（caffeicacid），对甲氧基桂皮酸（p-methoxycinnamicacid），间甲氧基桂皮酸（m-methoxycinnamicacid）。又含黄酮甙类：山柰酸-3，7-双葡萄糖甙（kaempferol-3，7-diglucoside），山柰酚-3-葡萄糖-7-葡萄糖甙（kaempferol-3-diglucoside-7-glucoside），山柰酚-3-葡萄糖-7-双葡萄糖甙（kaempferol-3-glucoside-7-diglucoside），棉花皮异甙（gossypitrin），草棉甙（herbacetrin），蜀葵甙元-3-双葡萄糖甙-8-葡萄糖甙[herbacetin-3-β-D-（2-O-β-D-glucopyranosidoglucopyranoside）-8-β-D-glucopyranoside]，棉花皮素-3-双葡萄糖甙-8-葡萄糖甙[gossypetin-3-β-D-（2-Oβ-D-glucopyranosidoglucopyranoside）-8-β-D-glucopyranoside]。另含生物碱：犬问荆碱（palustrine），及微量烟碱（nicotine），香草醛（vanillin），对羟基苯甲醛（p-hydroxybenzaldehyde），葡萄糖（glucose），果糖（fructose），及磷、硅、鞣质、皂甙等。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-qexq6gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-qexq6gm","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-qybx465","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-qybx465","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木贼所含的硅酸盐和鞣质有收敛作用，从而对于接触部位，有消炎，止血作用。同属植物E.ArvenseL.全草有利尿作用；临床上曾用以治糖尿病，但动物实验未能证实。牲畜食木贼及木贼属植物可引起中毒，症状有四肢无力、共济失调、转身困难，牲畜活动时产生震颤及肌肉强直，脉博弱而频，四肢发冷，血液化学分析表明维生素B缺乏，用大量维生素B有解毒作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-f5ifr80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-f5ifr80","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对心血管的作用：木贼醇提液能增加离体豚鼠心脏冠脉流量。0.2ml/kg（100%提取液）静脉注射对垂体后叶素引起的T波升高和心率减慢有一定的对抗和缓冲作用。木贼醇提物10-15g/kg腹腔注射或20g/kg十二指肠给药，对麻醉猫有持久的降压作用。降压强度和维持时间与剂量有一定的相关性。并能对抗组胺收缩血管作用，对切断脊髓的猫仍有降压作用，故认为其降压部位的外周性的。对家兔离体血管有明显扩张作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-khru6hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-khru6hi","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.其它作用：阿魏酸有抑制血小板聚集及释放的作用在动物实验中有镇静、抗惊厥作用，其半数致死量（mg/kg），小鼠腹腔注射为946，大鼠灌胃为3000。毒性表现为共济失调，肌肉强直及四肢发冷。血液分析表明维生素B缺乏，用大量维生素B治疗可恢复正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-74lj1nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-74lj1nn","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】1.取本品粉末4g，加甲醇10ml，温浸10min，滤过。取滤液1ml，加2%三氯化铁试剂1滴，溶液显蓝色至蓝黑色。（检查鞣质）2.取本品2g，加甲醇10ml，温浸1h，滤过。取滤液1ml，加10%α-萘酚乙醇溶液1-2滴，摇匀，沿管壁加浓硫酸0.5ml，接触面显紫红色。（检查糖）3.取本品粉末2g，加甲醇20ml，温浸1h，滤过。取滤液1ml，加镁粉少量与浓盐酸3滴，显紫红色。（检查黄酮）4.薄层色谱取本品粉末10g，置索氏提取器中，加甲醇70ml，回流提取4h，回收甲醇至少量，作为供试品溶液；另取阿魏酸为对照品。取供试品溶液10μl及对]照品溶液适量，点样于同一硅胶G（青岛）薄层板上（105℃活化1h），以正丁醇-乙酸-水（4：1：5）的上层液展开，喷以2%三氯化铝乙醇，晾干后置紫外光灯（254nm）下观察。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱的相应位置上，显相同颜色的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-vk3x6ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-vk3x6ls","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】洗净，稍润，剪去根部，切段，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-vahoxyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-vahoxyp","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘苦；平；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-h1orz7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-h1orz7g","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；肝；胆经"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-94491kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-94491kl","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】疏风清热；凉血止血；明目退翳。主风热目赤；目生云翳；迎风流泪；肠风下血；痔血；血痢；妇人月水不断；脱肛"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-yt43p5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-yt43p5g","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-10g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末撒敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-6pfd8h7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-6pfd8h7","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】气血虚者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-kh8itce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-kh8itce","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-w9gc6cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-w9gc6cs","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目》：木贼，与麻黄同形同性，故亦能发汗解肌，升散火郁风湿，治眼目诸血疾也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-vmv4kwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-vmv4kwv","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：木贼草，首主目疾，及退翳膜，益肝胆而明目也。其主积块、疗肠风、止痢，及妇人月水不断、崩中赤白、痔疾出血者，皆入血益肝胆之功，肝藏血故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-ci08iuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-ci08iuc","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经逢原》：木贼专主眼目风热，暴翳，止泪，取发散肝肺风邪也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-u4bo5he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-u4bo5he","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草求真》：木贼，书云形质有类麻黄，升散亦颇相似，但此气不辛热，且入足少阳胆、足厥阴肝，能于二经血分驱散风热，使血上通于目，故为去翳明目要剂，初非麻黄味辛性燥，专开在卫腠理而使身汗大出也。是以疝痛脱肛，肠风痔漏，赤痢崩带，诸血等症，审其果因风热而成者，得此则痛止肛收，肠固血止，而无不治之症矣。至其去翳明目，功虽有类谷精，能驾甘菊，但谷精则去星障，甘菊则止调和血药，于障全不能退，此则能去翳障也。然气血亏损，则用谷精、木贼去障，又当兼以芍药、熟地，滋补肝肾，使目得血能视。若徒用此二味退障，则即加以当归补助，亦恐气味辛散，非其所宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-2glky0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-2glky0g","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草正义》：木贼，治疗肝胆木邪横逆诸病，能消目翳，破积滞，皆消磨有余之用也。然则为目科要药者，固不仅取其克木，能磨擦障翳，亦含有疏风、泄化湿热、升散郁火诸义。其治喉痹、血痢、泻血、血痔、血崩、月事淋漓、疝气等证，固皆气滞血瘀，肝郁不疏为病，疏泄窒滞，升散郁热，兼以伐肝木之横，而顺其条达之性，木贼之用，尽于此矣。要知克削之力甚强，即治下血、血痢、血崩、血痔诸症，皆惟有余之体为宜，苟其气虚，皆当审慎，而血痢、便血、崩中及月事淋沥诸病，则气虚血不能摄者为多，尤不可不知所顾忌也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-8o6ywik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-8o6ywik","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《嘉佑本草》：主目疾，退翳膜。又消积块，益肝胆，明目，疗肠风，止痢及妇人月水不断。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-jgm208q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-jgm208q","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《纲目》：解肌，止泪，止血，去风湿，疝痛，大肠脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-434ucu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-434ucu4","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草正》：发汗，解肌。治伤寒、疟疾。去风湿，散火邪。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-a3f4r1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-a3f4r1q","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《王揪药解》：平疮疡肿硬，吐风狂痰涎。治痈疽瘰疬，疔毒，疖肿，汗斑，粉渣，崩中亦白诸证。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172427-dplub7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172427-dplub7m","updated":"20240830172521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172429-5w0pxdq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830172429-5w0pxdq","updated":"20240830172521"}},{"ID":"20240830172430-2p92745","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172430-2p92745","updated":"20240830172521"}}]}